### ApexPost.Api - success and failure request for every endpoint, v1 (deprecated) and v2. Fictional data only.
### Run the API: dotnet run --project ApexPost.Api --launch-profile https
@host = https://localhost:7301
@tn1 = APX-10000101
@tn2 = APX-10000201
### Tokens: dotnet run --project ApexPost.Api ... then GET {{host}}/dev/token?roles=Courier&courierId=courier-007 (Development only)
### or: dotnet user-jwts create --project ApexPost.Api --role Courier --claim courierId=courier-007
@courierToken = paste-a-Courier-token-here
@adminToken = paste-an-Admin-token-here
@partnerKey = paste-the-partner-key-from-user-secrets

######## V1 (deprecated: response carries api-deprecated-versions + Sunset headers)

### [v1] POST create - 201 Created + Location
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "trackingNumber": "{{tn1}}", "weightKg": 2.5, "recipientName": "Jordan Example",
  "recipientPhone": "+15550100123", "recipientAddress": "12 Elm Row", "city": "Maplewood" }

### [v1] POST create - 409 duplicate tracking number (send after the request above)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "trackingNumber": "{{tn1}}", "weightKg": 2.5, "recipientName": "Jordan Example",
  "recipientPhone": "+15550100123", "recipientAddress": "12 Elm Row", "city": "Maplewood" }

### [v1] POST create - 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "trackingNumber": "APX-123", "weightKg": 80, "recipientName": "", "recipientPhone": "call me", "recipientAddress": "", "city": "" }

### [v1] POST create - 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

trackingNumber={{tn1}}

### [v1] GET list - 200 paged and filtered
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Created&city=Maplewood
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] GET list - 400 pageSize above 50
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments?pageSize=51
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] GET one - 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] GET one - 404 unknown tracking number
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] PUT replace - 200
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "weightKg": 3.1, "recipientName": "Casey Sample", "recipientPhone": "+15550100999", "recipientAddress": "7 Oak Street", "city": "Riverton" }

### [v1] PUT replace - 404 unknown tracking number
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-99999999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "weightKg": 3.1, "recipientName": "Casey Sample", "recipientPhone": "+15550100999", "recipientAddress": "7 Oak Street", "city": "Riverton" }

### [v1] PATCH status - 200 Created -> PickedUp
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

{ "status": "PickedUp" }

### [v1] PATCH status - 409 invalid transition PickedUp -> Delivered
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

{ "status": "Delivered" }

### [v1] POST scans - 200 (send twice: the second response shows duplicatesSkipped = 2)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}/scans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

{ "scans": [
  { "scanId": "scan::3f2c9a5e-0b1d-4c7e-9a10-2b3c4d5e6f70", "scanType": "Pickup", "courierId": "courier-007",
    "location": "Maplewood Depot", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T08:00:00Z" },
  { "scanId": "scan::7a8b9c0d-1e2f-4a3b-8c4d-5e6f7a8b9c00", "scanType": "InTransit", "courierId": "courier-007",
    "location": "Northgate Hub", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T09:30:00Z" } ] }

### [v1] POST scans - 400 Delivered scan without a signature (custom IValidatableObject rule)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}/scans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

{ "scans": [ { "scanId": "scan::11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555551", "scanType": "Delivered", "courierId": "courier-007", "location": "12 Elm Row", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T10:00:00Z" } ] }

### [v1] GET scans - 200 history
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] GET scans - 404 unknown tracking number
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-99999999/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] DELETE - 409 (shipment was picked up above)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{tn1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [v1] DELETE - 204 (create a fresh Created shipment first)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "trackingNumber": "APX-10000109", "weightKg": 1.2, "recipientName": "Robin Test", "recipientPhone": "+15550100777", "recipientAddress": "3 Pine Close", "city": "Maplewood" }

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-10000109
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

