######## SECURITY (Part D)

### 401 - no token
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{tn2}}

### 401 - invalid token
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{tn2}}
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token

### 403 - Courier role cannot DELETE (Admin only)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{tn2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 403 - Admin role cannot upload scans (Courier only)
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{tn2}}/scans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "scans": [ { "scanId": "scan::22222222-3333-4444-8555-666666666666", "scanType": "Pickup", "courierId": "courier-007", "location": "Depot", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T08:00:00Z" } ] }

### 403 - courier uploads under another courierId
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{tn2}}/scans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

{ "scans": [ { "scanId": "scan::33333333-4444-4555-8666-777777777777", "scanType": "Pickup", "courierId": "courier-999", "location": "Depot", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T08:00:00Z" } ] }

### 200 - valid token (any authenticated user may read)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{tn2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### Partner API - 200 with a valid X-Api-Key
GET {{host}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/{{tn2}}
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}

### Partner API - 401 invalid key
GET {{host}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/{{tn2}}
X-Api-Key: wrong-key

### Partner API - 401 missing key
GET {{host}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/{{tn2}}

